sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User's Device
    participant Sen as Sensors (GPS, Camera, Mic, Accelerometer)
    participant Mon as Monitoring Orchestrator
    participant EF as Supabase Edge Functions
    participant AI as OpenAI (GPT-4o / Whisper)
    participant Alert as Twilio / SendGrid
    participant EC as Emergency Contact

    U->>Mon: Start Surveillance Session
    loop Every 20-30 seconds
        Mon->>Sen: Capture GPS + Camera snapshot (parallel)
        Sen-->>Mon: Location + Photo
        Mon->>Mon: Log placeholder event ("Analysing...")
        Mon->>Sen: Record ambient audio (async)
        Mon->>EF: analyse-image(photo, location)
        EF->>AI: GPT-4o Vision request
        AI-->>EF: risk level, summary
        EF-->>Mon: image risk result
        Sen-->>Mon: audio clip
        Mon->>EF: analyse-audio(clip)
        EF->>AI: Whisper transcription + GPT-4o analysis
        AI-->>EF: transcript, risk level
        EF-->>Mon: audio risk result
        Mon->>Mon: combineRisks(image, audio)
        alt Risk = Medium
            Mon->>U: Local push notification
        else Risk = High
            Mon->>EF: send-sms / send-email / make-call
            EF->>Alert: dispatch SMS, email, voice call
            Alert-->>EC: Alert delivered
        end
    end
    U->>Mon: Stop Surveillance Session
